<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>美股收盘日报｜{{ session_date or data.date }} 交易日</title>
    <meta name="description" content="{{ meta_description }}">
    <link rel="canonical" href="{{ canonical }}">
    <meta property="og:type" content="article">
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="美股收盘日报">
    <meta property="og:locale" content="zh_CN">
    <meta property="og:title" content="美股收盘日报｜{{ session_date or data.date }} 交易日">
    <meta property="og:description" content="{{ meta_description }}">
    <meta property="og:url" content="{{ canonical }}">
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary">
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="美股收盘日报｜{{ session_date or data.date }} 交易日">
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="{{ meta_description }}">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-page: rgb(246, 241, 231);
            --bg-card: rgba(246, 241, 231, 0.92);
            --border-card: rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.18);
            --shadow-card: 0 14px 34px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            --text-main: #1a1a1a;
            --text-muted: #5c5c5c;
            --accent: #2d6a4f;
            --accent-2: #357356;
            --danger: #bc382a;
            --warn: #b8860b;
            --info: #2471a3;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, "Noto Sans SC", sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 24px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(246, 241, 231) 0%, rgb(238, 233, 221) 100%);
            color: var(--text-main);
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 980px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            position: relative;
        }

        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2d6a4f, #357356);
            color: #fff;
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 28px 32px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            margin: 0 0 6px;
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }

        .hero p {
            margin: 0;
            opacity: .92;
            color: #f3f9f6;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #1a1a1a;
            margin: 28px 0 16px;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        h3 {
            color: #1f1f1f;
            margin: 18px 0 12px;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        h4 {
            color: #1f1f1f;
            margin: 12px 0 10px;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .section {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
            padding: 22px 24px;
            margin: 18px 0;
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 16px 18px;
        }

        .timeline .card {
            background: rgb(246, 241, 231);
            border: 1px solid rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.18);
            color: #1a1a1a;
        }

        .timeline h5 {
            margin: 0 0 6px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .timeline p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #2f2f2f;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 14px 0;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        th,
        td {
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            padding: 10px 12px;
            text-align: left;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }

        th {
            background: rgba(246, 241, 231, 0.95);
            color: #1a1a1a;
            font-weight: 800;
            border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            border-radius: 0;
        }

        tbody tr:nth-child(odd) {
            background: transparent;
        }

        tbody tr:nth-child(even) {
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.035);
        }

        tbody tr:hover {
            background: rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.08);
        }

        .positive {
            color: var(--accent-2);
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .negative {
            color: var(--danger);
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .neutral {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .green {
            color: var(--accent-2);
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .red {
            color: var(--danger);
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .summary-box {
            background: rgb(246, 241, 231);
            border: 1px solid rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.25);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 16px 18px;
            margin: 14px 0;
            color: #1a1a1a;
        }

        .highlight {
            background: rgb(254, 243, 199);
            border: 1px solid rgba(180, 140, 50, 0.28);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 16px 18px;
            margin: 14px 0;
            color: #1a1a1a;
        }

        .warning {
            background: rgb(254, 226, 226);
            border: 1px solid rgba(180, 70, 70, 0.28);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 16px 18px;
            margin: 14px 0;
            color: #1a1a1a;
        }

        .success {
            background: rgb(220, 245, 225);
            border: 1px solid rgba(45, 106, 79, 0.28);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 16px 18px;
            margin: 14px 0;
            color: #1a1a1a;
        }

        .source {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-top: 6px;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 32px;
            padding: 18px 0 6px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        /* ---- 作者署名 ---- */
        .author-badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; text-decoration: none; }
        .author-badge__avatar { display: block; width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 50%; overflow: hidden;
            background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,.10), 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.14); }
        .author-badge__avatar img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
        .hero .author-badge { margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .nk-copy { margin-top: 6px; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .01em; opacity: .82; }
        @media (max-width: 520px) { .author-badge__avatar { width: 32px; height: 32px; } }


        .section a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
        .section a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
        .toc { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 10px; align-items: center;
            margin: 4px 0 14px; padding: 10px 14px; background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-card); border-radius: 10px; font-size: 13px; }
        .toc b { color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600; margin-right: 2px; }
        .toc a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 6px; }
        .toc a:hover { background: rgba(45, 106, 79, .10); }
        .footer p {
            margin: 3px 0;
        }
    
/* 窄屏表格横向滚动（日报里的数据表在 390px 会顶出视口） */
@media (max-width: 560px) {
    table { display: block; max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
}

.hero h1 { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.hero h1 .author-badge { flex: 0 0 auto; }
@media (max-width: 560px) { .hero h1 { gap: 9px; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="hero">
            
            <h1><a class="author-badge" href="https://nekomini520.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="Nekomini · 作者" aria-label="Nekomini · 作者"><span class="author-badge__avatar"><img src="/author-badge.jpg" srcset="/author-badge.jpg 160w, /author-badge@2x.jpg 320w" sizes="38px" width="38" height="38" alt="Nekomini" decoding="async"></span></a>📈 美股收盘日报｜美股 {{ session_date or data.date }} 交易日收盘</h1>
            <p>专业、简洁、高信息密度 · 每日10分钟掌握美股核心动态</p>
            <p class="meta">本报告于北京时间 {{ generated_at }} 生成，覆盖美股 {{ session_date or data.date }} 这一交易日的收盘数据。</p>
        </div>

        <nav class="toc" aria-label="目录">
            <b>目录</b>
            <a href="#summary">总结</a>
            <a href="#s1">大盘</a><a href="#s2">盘中</a><a href="#s3">宏观</a>
            <a href="#s4">板块</a><a href="#s5">主题</a><a href="#s6">技术</a>
            <a href="#s7">个股</a><a href="#s8">轮动</a><a href="#s9">关注股</a>
            <a href="#s10">明日</a><a href="#s11">风险</a><a href="#s12">结论</a>
        </nav>

        <!-- 0. 今日一句话总结 -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 id="summary">💡 今日一句话总结</h2>
            <div class="summary-box">
                {% if ok(market_summary) %}<p><strong>今日市场状态：</strong>{{ market_summary }}</p>{% endif %}
                {% if ok(market_driver) %}<p><strong>核心驱动因素：</strong>{{ market_driver }}</p>{% endif %}
                {% if ok(market_sentiment) %}<p><strong>资金情绪：</strong>{{ market_sentiment }}</p>{% endif %}
                {% if ok(main_focus) %}<p><strong>最值得关注主线：</strong>{{ main_focus }}</p>{% endif %}
            </div>
        </div>
        <br><hr>

        <!-- 1. 大盘表现总览 -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 id="s1">📊 1.大盘表现总览</h2>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>指数</th>
                        <th>收盘点位</th>
                        <th>涨跌幅</th>
                        <th>日内高低点</th>
                        <th>成交量</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% for name, index in data.indices.items() %}
                    {% if name != "VIX" %}
                    <tr>
                        <td>{% if index.symbol %}<a href="https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/{{ index.symbol }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">{{ name }}</a>{% else %}{{ name }}{% endif %}</td>
                        <td>{{ index.price|round(2) }}</td>
                        <td class="{% if index.change_pct > 0 %}positive{% elif index.change_pct < 0 %}negative{% else %}neutral{% endif %}">
                            {% if index.change_pct > 0 %}+{% endif %}{{ index.change_pct|round(2) }}%
                        </td>
                        <td>{{ index.low|round(2) }} - {{ index.high|round(2) }}</td>
                        <td>{% if index.volume %}{{ index.volume|compact }}{% endif %}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        <br><hr>

        <!-- 2. 盘中走势复盘 -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 id="s2">⏰ 2.盘中走势复盘</h2>
            <div class="timeline">
                <h3>🕒 日内数据（来自日线行情，无分时数据源）：</h3>
                <div class="card">
                    <h4>📉 日内最低</h4>
                    <p>{{ pre_market }}</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h5>📈 日内最高</h5>
                    <p>{{ opening }}</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h5>🏁 收盘</h5>
                    <p>{{ midday }}</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h5>📊 日内位置</h5>
                    <p>{{ closing }}</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="highlight">
                <h4>🎯 核心原因分析：</h4>
                <p>{{ core_reason }}</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <br><hr>

        <!-- 3. 宏观环境 -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 id="s3">🌍 3.宏观环境</h2>
            
            <!-- 3.1 美债收益率 -->
            <h3>3.1 美债收益率</h3>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>项目</th>
                        <th>最新水平</th>
                        <th>日变化</th>
                        <th>市场含义</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% for name, bond in data.macro.items() %}
                    {% if name in ["10Y收益率", "30Y收益率", "13T国债", "5Y Treasury"] %}
                    <tr>
                        <td>{{ name }}</td>
                        <td>{{ bond.price|round(3) }}%</td>
                        <td class="{% if bond.change_pct is defined and bond.change_pct and bond.change_pct > 0 %}positive{% elif bond.change_pct is defined and bond.change_pct and bond.change_pct < 0 %}negative{% else %}neutral{% endif %}">
                            {% if bond.change_pct is defined and bond.change_pct %}{% if bond.change_pct > 0 %}+{% endif %}{{ bond.change_pct|round(2) }}%{% endif %}
                        </td>
                        <td>{{ bond_meaning(name, bond) }}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
            </table>
            <div class="highlight">
                <h4>📊 债市分析：</h4>
                {% if ok(bond_analysis_summary) %}<p>{{ bond_analysis_summary }}</p>{% endif %}
            </div>

            <!-- 3.3 美元、黄金、原油、比特币 -->
            <h3>3.2 美元、黄金、铜、原油、加密货币</h3>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>资产</th>
                        <th>最新价格</th>
                        <th>涨跌幅</th>
                        <th>含义</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% for name, asset in data.macro.items() %}
                    {% if name in ["美元指数DXY", "黄金", "铜期货", "WTI原油", "比特币", "以太坊"] %}
                    <tr>
                        <td>{{ name }}</td>
                        <td>{{ asset.price }}</td>
                        <td class="{% if asset.change_pct > 0 %}positive{% elif asset.change_pct < 0 %}negative{% else %}neutral{% endif %}">
                            {% if asset.change_pct > 0 %}+{% endif %}{{ asset.change_pct|round(2) }}%
                        </td>
                        <td>{{ asset_meaning(name, asset) }}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        <br><hr>

        <!-- 4. 板块表现 -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 id="s4">🏢 4.板块表现</h2>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>排名</th>
                        <th>板块</th>
                        <th>ETF</th>
                        <th>当日涨跌幅</th>
                        <th>近5日</th>
                        <th>近1月</th>
                        <th>跑赢/跑输标普</th>
                        <th>主要驱动</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% for sector in sectors_performance %}
                    <tr>
                        <td>{{ loop.index }}</td>
                        <td>{{ sector.name }}</td>
                        <td>{% if sector.symbol %}<a href="https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/{{ sector.symbol }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">{{ sector.etf or sector.symbol }}</a>{% else %}{{ sector.etf }}{% endif %}</td>
                        <td class="{% if sector.change > 0 %}positive{% elif sector.change < 0 %}negative{% else %}neutral{% endif %}">
                            {% if sector.change > 0 %}+{% endif %}{{ sector.change|round(2) }}%
                        </td>
                        <td>{{ sector.change_5d|round(2) }}%</td>
                        <td>{{ sector.change_1m|round(2) }}%</td>
                        <td>{{ sector.vs_sp500 }}</td>
                        <td>{{ sector.driver }}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
            </table>
            <div class="highlight">
                <h3>🎯 板块分析：</h3>
                {% if ok(sector_analysis) %}<p>{{ sector_analysis }}</p>{% endif %}
            </div>
        </div>
        <br><hr>

        <!-- 5. 主题与风格表现 -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 id="s5">🎨 5.主题与风格表现</h2>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>主题/风格</th>
                        <th>代表ETF</th>
                        <th>当日涨跌幅</th>
                        <th>近5日</th>
                        <th>近1月</th>
                        <th>解读</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% for theme in themes_performance %}
                    <tr>
                        <td>{{ theme.name }}</td>
                        <td>{{ theme.etf }}</td>
                        <td class="{% if theme.change > 0 %}positive{% elif theme.change < 0 %}negative{% else %}neutral{% endif %}">
                            {% if theme.change > 0 %}+{% endif %}{{ theme.change|round(2) }}%
                        </td>
                        <td>{{ theme.change_5d|round(2) }}%</td>
                        <td>{{ theme.change_1m|round(2) }}%</td>
                        <td>{{ theme.analysis }}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
            </table>
            <div class="highlight">
                <h3>🔍 主题分析：</h3>
                {% if ok(theme_analysis) %}<p>{{ theme_analysis }}</p>{% endif %}
            </div>
        </div>
        <br><hr>

        <!-- 7. 技术面分析 -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 id="s6">📈 6.技术面分析</h2>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr><th>标的</th><th>当前价格</th><th>当日涨跌</th><th>日内区间</th></tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% for tech in technical_analysis %}
                    {% if tech.price is defined and tech.price %}
                    <tr>
                        <td>{{ tech.symbol }}</td>
                        <td>{{ tech.price|round(2) }}</td>
                        <td class="{% if tech.change_pct is defined and tech.change_pct and tech.change_pct > 0 %}positive{% elif tech.change_pct is defined and tech.change_pct and tech.change_pct < 0 %}negative{% else %}neutral{% endif %}">
                            {% if tech.change_pct is defined and tech.change_pct %}{% if tech.change_pct > 0 %}+{% endif %}{{ tech.change_pct|round(2) }}%{% endif %}
                        </td>
                        <td>{% if tech.low is defined and tech.low and tech.high is defined and tech.high %}{{ tech.low|round(2) }} - {{ tech.high|round(2) }}{% endif %}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
            </table>
            <p class="meta">均线、RSI、MACD 需要日线历史数据，当前采集源（Yahoo Finance 盘后快照）不提供，因此不展示这几列。</p>
        </div>
        <br><hr>

        <!-- 8. 重点个股新闻与异动 -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 id="s7">🔥 7.重点个股新闻与异动</h2>
            
            <!-- 8.1 大型科技七巨头 -->
            <h3>7.1 大型科技七巨头</h3>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>股票</th>
                        <th>当日涨跌</th>
                        <th>近5日</th>
                        <th>近1月</th>
                        <th>日内区间</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% for stock in magnificent_7 %}
                    <tr>
                        <td><a href="https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/{{ stock.symbol }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">{{ stock.symbol }}</a></td>
                        <td class="{{ stock.cls }}">
                            {{ stock.chg_text }}
                        </td>
                        <td class="{{ stock.cls_5d }}">{{ stock.chg_5d_text }}</td>
                        <td class="{{ stock.cls_1m }}">{{ stock.chg_1m_text }}</td>
                        <td>{{ stock.range }}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
            </table>

            <!-- 8.2 AI硬件/半导体 -->
            <h3>7.2 AI硬件/半导体</h3>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>股票</th>
                        <th>当日涨跌</th>
                        <th>近5日</th>
                        <th>近1月</th>
                        <th>日内区间</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% for stock in ai_hardware %}
                    <tr>
                        <td><a href="https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/{{ stock.symbol }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">{{ stock.symbol }}</a></td>
                        <td class="{{ stock.cls }}">
                            {{ stock.chg_text }}
                        </td>
                        <td class="{{ stock.cls_5d }}">{{ stock.chg_5d_text }}</td>
                        <td class="{{ stock.cls_1m }}">{{ stock.chg_1m_text }}</td>
                        <td>{{ stock.range }}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        <br><hr>

        <!-- 11. 板块轮动判断 -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 id="s8">🔄 8.板块轮动判断</h2>
            <div class="highlight">
                <h3>当前市场状态：</h3>
                <p>{{ market_state }}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h4>📊 资金流向：</h4>
                <p><strong>{{ money_flow_in_label|default("主要流入", true) }}：</strong>{{ money_flow_in }}</p>
                <p><strong>主要流出：</strong>{{ money_flow_out }}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h4>🔍 主线判断：</h4>
                <p>{{ main_line_analysis }}</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <br><hr>

        <!-- 12. 我的重点关注股观察 -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 id="s9">🔍 9.我的重点关注股观察</h2>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>股票</th>
                        <th>当日涨跌</th>
                        <th>近5日</th>
                        <th>近1月</th>
                        <th>日内低点</th>
                        <th>日内高点</th>
                        <th>当日表现</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% for focus in focus_stocks %}
                    <tr>
                        <td>{{ focus.symbol }}</td>
                        <td class="{{ focus.cls }}">{{ focus.chg_text }}</td>
                        <td class="{{ focus.cls_5d }}">{{ focus.chg_5d_text }}</td>
                        <td class="{{ focus.cls_1m }}">{{ focus.chg_1m_text }}</td>
                        <td>{{ focus.low|round(2) }}</td>
                        <td>{{ focus.high|round(2) }}</td>
                        <td class="{{ focus.cls }}">{{ focus.judgment }}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        <br><hr>

        <!-- 13. 明日交易计划/观察清单 -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 id="s10">📅 10.明日交易计划/观察清单</h2>
            
            <!-- 13.1 宏观观察 -->
            <h3>10.1 宏观观察</h3>
            <div class="card">
                <h4>🔍 关键观察点：</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>10Y美债收益率：</strong>{{ ten_yield_observation }}</li>
                    <li><strong>美元指数方向：</strong>{{ dollar_observation }}</li>
                    <li><strong>油价/黄金/VIX：</strong>{{ commodity_observation }}</li>
                    <li><strong>Fed官员讲话：</strong>{{ fed_speech_observation }}</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
		
        <!-- 14. 风险提示 -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 id="s11">⚠️ 11.风险提示</h2>
            <div class="warning">
                <h3>当前市场最大风险：</h3>
                <p>{{ main_risk }}</p>
            </div>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>风险维度</th>
                        <th>当前状态</th>
                        <th>风险等级</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>宏观利率</td>
                        <td>{{ macro_rate_status }}</td>
                        <td class="{% if macro_risk_level == '高' %}negative{% elif macro_risk_level == '中高' %}neutral{% else %}positive{% endif %}">
                            {{ macro_risk_level }}
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>市场宽度</td>
                        <td>{{ breadth_status }}</td>
                        <td class="{% if breadth_risk_level == '高' %}negative{% elif breadth_risk_level == '中高' %}neutral{% else %}positive{% endif %}">
                            {{ breadth_risk_level }}
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>AI拥挤度</td>
                        <td>{{ ai_crowding_status }}</td>
                        <td class="{% if ai_crowding_risk_level == '高' %}negative{% elif ai_crowding_risk_level == '中高' %}neutral{% else %}positive{% endif %}">
                            {{ ai_crowding_risk_level }}
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>财报风险</td>
                        <td>{{ earnings_risk_status }}</td>
                        <td class="{% if earnings_risk_level == '高' %}negative{% elif earnings_risk_level == '中高' %}neutral{% else %}positive{% endif %}">
                            {{ earnings_risk_level }}
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        <br><hr>

        <!-- 15. 最终结论 -->
        <div class="section">
            <h2 id="s12">🧭 12.最终结论</h2>
            <div class="summary-box">
                <h3>📌 今日市场结论</h3>
                <p>{{ market_conclusion }}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h4>🔍 当前市场阶段</h4>
                <p>{{ market_phase }}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h4>💼 我的操作倾向</h4>
                <p>{{ trading_bias }}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="success">
                <h4>🎯 最值得关注的信号</h4>
                <ul>
                    {% for signal in key_signals %}
                    <li>{{ signal }}</li>
                    {% endfor %}
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>📊 数据来源：<a href="https://finance.yahoo.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">Yahoo Finance</a>（盘后行情快照，每个代码都链回原页可核对） | 📧 Created by：Nekomini Bot | 📅 {{ generated_at }}（北京时间 UTC+8）</p>
            <p><a href="/archive/">往期归档</a></p>
            <p>power by Nekomini</p>
            <p class="nk-copy">© 2026 Nekomini</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>